WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:10.010 --> 00:00:14.100
[Subtitles by danielsangeo]

00:00:15.791 --> 00:00:17.451
Something just occurred to me.

00:00:17.451 --> 00:00:22.544
This could be one of those TVs that you
literally can't operate without the remote.

00:00:22.544 --> 00:00:26.060
One of the aliens could've panicked
and swallowed it as a security measure

00:00:26.060 --> 00:00:27.984
once they heard me come in here.

00:00:27.984 --> 00:00:30.548
If so, then... checkmate.

00:00:30.548 --> 00:00:33.853
I'm not performing an autopsy
just to find the remote.

00:00:33.853 --> 00:00:35.133
Oh, a vent.

00:00:35.133 --> 00:00:36.899
What the hell is this red stuff?

00:00:36.899 --> 00:00:39.424
I don't like how it
just hangs in the air.

00:00:39.424 --> 00:00:43.329
Best case scenario: this is some
sort of cleaning agent.

00:00:43.329 --> 00:00:47.431
Worst case: it's an overgrown
bacteria that's already infected me,

00:00:47.431 --> 00:00:50.603
and will take over my lungs in 72 hours.

00:00:50.603 --> 00:00:52.216
I'm still hoping...

00:00:52.216 --> 00:00:53.567
...my DNA...

00:00:54.338 --> 00:00:55.701
...is too foreign...

00:00:56.279 --> 00:00:57.634
...for the native life...

00:00:58.095 --> 00:00:59.367
...to take hold.

00:01:00.147 --> 00:01:04.435
I mean, if not, I'm going to have
the alien equivalent of black lung.

00:01:04.435 --> 00:01:05.926
Look at this stuff.

00:01:05.926 --> 00:01:08.291
Really red lung.

00:01:08.291 --> 00:01:11.200
Oh, okay, do I take this one or...

00:01:12.086 --> 00:01:14.015
It's probably the same thing.

00:01:14.015 --> 00:01:16.595
This is just a giant pair of nostrils.

00:01:16.595 --> 00:01:19.317
So, that means I'm about to
enter the mustache.

00:01:19.317 --> 00:01:21.574
It's good to go in heavily armed.

00:01:21.574 --> 00:01:23.019
THIS IS WORSE THAN I THOUGHT!

00:01:23.019 --> 00:01:23.703
[vortigaunts charging up]

00:01:23.703 --> 00:01:24.596
[vortigaunt bolt]
[shudder]

00:01:24.596 --> 00:01:25.720
BLAH!

00:01:25.720 --> 00:01:27.400
Fucking electrical beams!

00:01:29.193 --> 00:01:32.367
I'M GONNA HAVE NERVE DAMAGE,
I'VE BEEN SHOCKED SO MANY TIMES!

00:01:33.641 --> 00:01:35.642
YEAH, THAT'S RIGHT!
EVERYBODY INTO THE PIT!

00:01:35.642 --> 00:01:37.716
THAT'S WHERE EVERYTHING COOL IS HAPPENING!

00:01:37.716 --> 00:01:40.167
JUST JUMP RIGHT IN,
DON'T WORRY ABOUT ANYTHING!

00:01:40.617 --> 00:01:42.767
SEE?! YOU SHOULD'VE
JUMPED INTO THE PIT!

00:01:42.767 --> 00:01:44.901
IT'S A PIT PARTY AND YOU'RE INVITED!

00:01:45.731 --> 00:01:48.509
Aww, you didn't fall the right way.

00:01:48.509 --> 00:01:51.753
Well, there are certain standards
you have to adhere to.

00:01:51.753 --> 00:01:54.841
Man, I'm in the pit, too, metaphorically.

00:01:54.841 --> 00:01:59.921
I have to hand it to them--the scientists
REALLY knew how to screw me.

00:01:59.921 --> 00:02:02.212
They didn't go halfway on this.

00:02:02.212 --> 00:02:05.384
I can almost respect
that level of commitment,

00:02:05.384 --> 00:02:10.058
but at the same time, that's what it took
to take me down. And now look at me.

00:02:10.058 --> 00:02:14.026
The big joke of all this is I don't think
that this was an act of revenge.

00:02:14.026 --> 00:02:15.710
[alien controller call]
What was that?

00:02:15.710 --> 00:02:19.351
Eh, it must be nothing. These
guys aren't that big on stealth.

00:02:19.351 --> 00:02:21.094
[vortigaunt charging up]
WHERE'D YOU COME FROM?!

00:02:21.094 --> 00:02:22.389
[vortigaunt bolt]
[shudder]

00:02:22.389 --> 00:02:25.570
THE PIT PARTY DOES NOT STOP!

00:02:25.570 --> 00:02:26.659
BLAH!

00:02:26.659 --> 00:02:31.038
Aliens! Come out to play!

00:02:31.038 --> 00:02:36.560
ALIENS! COME OUT TO PLAY!

00:02:36.560 --> 00:02:41.313
ALIENS! COME OUT TO PLAY-AY!

00:02:41.313 --> 00:02:44.470
Yeah, that's it! They're
waiting for you down there.

00:02:44.470 --> 00:02:47.051
No worries. You're fashionably late.

00:02:47.051 --> 00:02:50.017
Well, I don't see anything else.

00:02:50.017 --> 00:02:54.403
Just this architecture straight
out of Willy Wonka versus Hellraiser.

00:02:54.403 --> 00:02:55.940
[vortigaunt charging up]
How did I miss him?!

00:02:55.940 --> 00:02:58.734
[vortigaunt bolt]
OH! You missed ME!

00:02:59.506 --> 00:03:03.599
Today we learned that explosive
projectiles have better range

00:03:03.599 --> 00:03:07.149
than electricity arcing into the open air.

00:03:07.149 --> 00:03:10.465
You think because it's humid in
here, you're the god of lightning.

00:03:10.465 --> 00:03:13.244
Well, I have news for you:
you're not!

00:03:13.244 --> 00:03:17.257
So, what was I thinking about?
Oh, yeah. Revenge!

00:03:17.257 --> 00:03:21.253
While there's no doubt in my mind the
scientists did this to me intentionally,

00:03:21.253 --> 00:03:24.082
I don't think it was personally motivated.

00:03:24.082 --> 00:03:27.492
They sent hundreds of people
here without batting an eye.

00:03:27.492 --> 00:03:29.725
There's no reason to think
I was an exception.

00:03:29.725 --> 00:03:30.400
[vortigaunt charging up]
Uh oh!

00:03:30.926 --> 00:03:36.244
The thing I don't get is, I'm not sure ANY
effort was made to recover the bodies.

00:03:36.244 --> 00:03:40.285
So, if we were just sending people
one way, how did we learn anything?

00:03:40.285 --> 00:03:42.493
I'm not sure we did, really.

00:03:42.493 --> 00:03:45.259
We just put them in suits,
gave them a slap on the back,

00:03:45.259 --> 00:03:47.714
and told them they'd
figure out how to return.

00:03:47.714 --> 00:03:50.300
Classic pass-the-buck planning.

00:03:51.229 --> 00:03:53.343
[straining]

00:03:53.343 --> 00:03:55.999
[straining]
Throw it... off the edge...

00:03:55.999 --> 00:03:57.114
Can't.

00:03:57.114 --> 00:03:58.434
Okay! Going up!

00:03:59.245 --> 00:04:01.712
Oh, jeez. Getting dizzy...

00:04:01.712 --> 00:04:03.120
[vortigaunt charging up]
Wuh...

00:04:03.120 --> 00:04:03.809
[vortigaunt bolt]
[shudder]

00:04:03.809 --> 00:04:05.404
WAAH! AAAH! AAAH!

00:04:05.404 --> 00:04:08.362
NO! I'M SPINNING! DON'T THROW ME OFF!

00:04:08.362 --> 00:04:09.381
[alien controller call]
What?

00:04:09.381 --> 00:04:10.546
[vortigaunt charging up]
OW!

00:04:10.546 --> 00:04:11.809
[vortigaunt bolt]
[shudder]

00:04:11.809 --> 00:04:14.442
[screaming]

00:04:14.442 --> 00:04:16.208
WHAT ARE--
[shudder]

00:04:16.208 --> 00:04:17.551
BLAA-AAAGH!

00:04:17.551 --> 00:04:20.963
BACK THE FUCK UP!
THIS IS MY TURF NOW!

00:04:20.963 --> 00:04:22.744
WHAT-AAH!

00:04:22.744 --> 00:04:28.165
STOP MOVING, YOU SWIRLY FUCKS!
I'LL TEACH YOU HOW TO STAND STILL!

00:04:28.165 --> 00:04:31.847
Yeah, that was tight! Who said
anything about vomiting?

00:04:31.847 --> 00:04:35.266
I-I-I didn't say anything about vomiting.

00:04:35.266 --> 00:04:39.338
But, y'know, I mean, this would
be a good place to do it, though.

00:04:39.338 --> 00:04:41.160
I can't deny that.

00:04:41.160 --> 00:04:45.575
I mean, you have this big drop and the
low gravity and it'd be perfect.

00:04:45.575 --> 00:04:47.995
But, yeah, I'm not gonna vomit.

00:04:47.995 --> 00:04:52.680
I've got so little food in my stomach,
all I could do would be to dry heave.

00:04:52.680 --> 00:04:54.785
I don't want to do that.

00:04:54.785 --> 00:04:58.917
So, I guess the inner ears of aliens
work very differently than ours

00:04:58.917 --> 00:05:02.934
if they think that spinning
corkscrew elevators are a good idea.

00:05:02.934 --> 00:05:07.076
Yeah, look at this place. They
fucking love their spirals, don't they?

00:05:07.076 --> 00:05:09.445
They're screwy like that!

00:05:09.445 --> 00:05:11.830
You're screwed!

00:05:11.830 --> 00:05:12.831
[vortigaunt charging up]

00:05:13.257 --> 00:05:16.000
Shit! More of those
jack-in-the-box soldiers!

00:05:16.000 --> 00:05:18.120
I'll teach you to leave your barrel!

00:05:18.120 --> 00:05:20.016
This is what you can expect!

00:05:20.016 --> 00:05:22.415
Yeah, your bees won't save you now!

00:05:22.415 --> 00:05:24.784
[explosions]

00:05:24.784 --> 00:05:26.734
There! That should--Jesus!

00:05:28.003 --> 00:05:28.715
Ah!

00:05:28.715 --> 00:05:31.460
Bees and brutes and... barrels...

00:05:31.460 --> 00:05:35.051
You know, I remember some of our
soldiers popping out of a box.

00:05:35.051 --> 00:05:38.736
Now I'm wondering if they come up with
the idea after watching these guys.

00:05:38.736 --> 00:05:41.451
As if they're advanced
tactics or something.

00:05:41.451 --> 00:05:44.611
Yeah, look at this walkway.
There's not even any guardrails.

00:05:44.611 --> 00:05:47.891
I'd say the aliens are as
advanced as they are backwards,

00:05:47.891 --> 00:05:50.039
but that's an gross simplification.

00:05:50.039 --> 00:05:52.120
It's more like they're a
mess of a society

00:05:52.120 --> 00:05:55.617
that's managed to stumble upon a
couple of advanced technologies.

00:05:55.617 --> 00:05:58.129
Ah, satchel charges!

00:05:58.129 --> 00:06:00.749
Damn, I don't think
I can carry much more.

00:06:00.749 --> 00:06:03.035
I'll just come back here
if the need arises,

00:06:03.035 --> 00:06:05.624
which it... probably will eventually.

00:06:05.624 --> 00:06:08.286
Okay, nothing here except our stuff.

00:06:08.286 --> 00:06:09.712
See, this is what I mean.

00:06:09.712 --> 00:06:11.709
All of our weaponry that's
been teleported here

00:06:11.709 --> 00:06:14.139
is just lying around like it's garbage.

00:06:14.139 --> 00:06:17.608
If the aliens had our intelligence,
they would be hoarding this stuff

00:06:17.608 --> 00:06:19.473
and studying the hell out of it.

00:06:19.473 --> 00:06:22.129
Our weapons are obviously
better than theirs.

00:06:22.129 --> 00:06:24.692
Christ, some of our scientists
were studying the aliens

00:06:24.692 --> 00:06:27.664
at Black Mesa while it was under attack!

00:06:27.664 --> 00:06:29.363
That's how ahead of them we are.

00:06:29.363 --> 00:06:33.671
And yet, they have forcefields,
manufacture their own soldiers,

00:06:33.671 --> 00:06:37.312
and use teleporters like they're
bus stops. I don't get it.

00:06:37.312 --> 00:06:38.899
Hey, there's somebody up there.

00:06:38.899 --> 00:06:40.191
I don't trust him.

00:06:40.191 --> 00:06:42.067
He's giving me this mystical look.

00:06:42.959 --> 00:06:45.186
Ah, damn. Thought I had him.

00:06:45.186 --> 00:06:46.397
Okay...

00:06:46.397 --> 00:06:47.598
Oh, c'mon!

00:06:47.598 --> 00:06:49.234
Well, he's standing still...

00:06:49.870 --> 00:06:51.986
Did I get him? I think I did.

00:06:51.986 --> 00:06:53.193
I should go check.

00:06:53.193 --> 00:06:57.300
I hope he was their prophet. That would
be a nice omen for them to dwell on.

00:07:00.394 --> 00:07:04.876
Some shells! Yeah, buckshot,
alien shot, it's all the same.

00:07:04.876 --> 00:07:07.560
Man, they have tripmines
lying around, too,

00:07:07.560 --> 00:07:10.475
but that's more for when
I go to sleep, y'know?

00:07:10.475 --> 00:07:13.455
Okay, almost to the top and-- Oh!

00:07:13.455 --> 00:07:14.601
Are you gonna...? Yep!

00:07:15.234 --> 00:07:19.616
Man, I really hope I did kill
their prophet or oracle or whatever.

00:07:19.616 --> 00:07:23.506
That actually would explain this
elaborate and impractical architecture;

00:07:23.506 --> 00:07:24.905
if this was a temple?

00:07:24.905 --> 00:07:28.368
Why not? Just build it right
next to the manufacturing plant.

00:07:28.368 --> 00:07:31.707
Floating island space
is limited after all.

00:07:31.707 --> 00:07:35.726
If I get up there and find some religious
symbols, I'm gonna wear them as a hat.

00:07:35.726 --> 00:07:37.783
If I'm lucky, they'll bow down to me.

00:07:37.783 --> 00:07:40.417
But, if not, I might
at least demoralize them.

00:07:40.417 --> 00:07:41.999
If I want to go the extra mile,

00:07:41.999 --> 00:07:44.993
I could cut off the leader's
head and wear it around my neck.

00:07:44.993 --> 00:07:50.353
I think among complete aliens, that still
sends a pretty universal message.

00:07:50.353 --> 00:07:52.283
Eh, I probably won't do that.

00:07:52.283 --> 00:07:55.127
It would smell awful plus I
don't have any rope.

00:07:55.127 --> 00:07:58.826
There hast to be SOME way to
instill fear in these things.

00:07:58.826 --> 00:08:01.514
Although those fliers just
come at me kamikaze

00:08:01.514 --> 00:08:04.050
even when I blow their
friends out of the air.

00:08:04.050 --> 00:08:06.182
Fucking aliens, man.

00:08:06.182 --> 00:08:10.365
Oh, so here's the big surprise.
Another dead researcher.

00:08:10.365 --> 00:08:13.469
Yeah, this guy just fell to his death.

00:08:13.469 --> 00:08:17.292
He wouldn't walk through the other
aliens just to come up here to die.

00:08:17.292 --> 00:08:19.020
Oh, a memento!

00:08:19.020 --> 00:08:23.281
Oh, yeah. Dead explorers
leave the best mementos.

00:08:23.281 --> 00:08:27.221
If it's not supplies, you get a
long detailed log of what happened.

00:08:27.221 --> 00:08:30.247
I still can't believe we sent
so many to their deaths.

00:08:30.247 --> 00:08:34.432
I mean, this is already more people than
have ever died in the space program.

00:08:34.432 --> 00:08:35.534
Shortcut!

00:08:36.518 --> 00:08:40.224
Yah! I am the master of navigation.

00:08:40.224 --> 00:08:41.868
Well... uh...

00:08:42.610 --> 00:08:43.147
Yah!

00:08:43.147 --> 00:08:48.270
But, yeah, they didn't send me here to
get even. I'm just meat in the grinder.

00:08:48.270 --> 00:08:52.124
There's a fucking Mengele on the
other end of those teleporter controls,

00:08:52.124 --> 00:08:56.292
and he's not going to stop until
he's teleported the entire world here

00:08:56.292 --> 00:08:58.127
or else somebody kills him.

00:08:58.127 --> 00:09:03.184
I did think it was weird how they were
talking like, oh, I'm the last hope.

00:09:03.184 --> 00:09:05.906
Yet there was a gung ho security
guard standing around

00:09:05.906 --> 00:09:08.798
with an arsenal of weapons
and spare suits?

00:09:08.798 --> 00:09:13.101
I guess they were just all in on it, or else
they were saving the guard for last

00:09:13.101 --> 00:09:17.657
since they need somebody to shoot at the
Feds when they come in to shut them down.

00:09:17.657 --> 00:09:21.915
Okay. I don't want to do
this, but... Going up!

00:09:23.119 --> 00:09:24.722
This is gonna suck.

00:09:24.722 --> 00:09:29.275
Oh God!  Okay, uh...
focus on point! Focus on point!

00:09:29.275 --> 00:09:31.059
Don't look at things!

00:09:31.059 --> 00:09:33.196
[alien controller call]
Shit, I looked at something!

00:09:33.196 --> 00:09:35.171
Oh, no! Not now!

00:09:35.171 --> 00:09:37.834
Okay! This isn't spinning as much...

00:09:39.152 --> 00:09:40.781
Stop moving, please...!

00:09:40.781 --> 00:09:42.167
Is that everyone?

00:09:42.748 --> 00:09:43.567
Wait...

00:09:44.416 --> 00:09:46.295
No, you're not the TARDIS.

00:09:46.295 --> 00:09:47.226
Okay.

00:09:47.226 --> 00:09:48.934
[alien controller call]
OH, ANOTHER ONE!

00:09:49.983 --> 00:09:51.033
NYAH!

00:09:52.810 --> 00:09:56.400
CRAMPED HALLWAYS ARE NOT YOUR
NATURAL ENVIRONMENT, YOU IDIOT!

00:09:57.871 --> 00:09:59.111
YOURS EITHER!

00:09:59.111 --> 00:10:04.838
Man! I'm definitely not convinced these are
the intelligent species around here now.

00:10:04.838 --> 00:10:07.918
They basically act like dogs
strapped to jetpacks

00:10:07.918 --> 00:10:10.714
that can shoot ball lightning
from their paws.

00:10:10.714 --> 00:10:14.020
They seem to be coming from the
top; I guess there's something up there.

00:10:14.020 --> 00:10:16.612
Maybe that rotating spark thing.

00:10:16.612 --> 00:10:19.245
Okay, this is the LAST one I'm doing.

00:10:19.245 --> 00:10:20.772
Jesus Christ...

00:10:20.772 --> 00:10:23.000
It's spin time!

00:10:23.980 --> 00:10:26.521
Oh, shit! I need to move with it, don't I?

00:10:26.521 --> 00:10:29.957
Err, wait, no! I need to move
against it to undo it!

00:10:29.957 --> 00:10:31.748
Oh God, it's happening!

00:10:31.748 --> 00:10:33.411
THIS IS SPINNING, TOO!

00:10:33.411 --> 00:10:34.235
Whuh-AAH-AA--

00:10:34.235 --> 00:10:35.627
[fzzt]

00:10:35.627 --> 00:10:36.860
--AAH!

00:10:36.860 --> 00:10:39.355
Okay, that's a little better...

00:10:39.355 --> 00:10:40.499
It's calming down...

00:10:40.499 --> 00:10:41.784
What IS this?

00:10:41.784 --> 00:10:45.162
Okay, so that WAS a
teleporter. That's good?

00:10:45.162 --> 00:10:46.878
Why are there no stars?

00:10:46.878 --> 00:10:50.982
I must be in a cavern or
maybe a really thick cloud.

00:10:50.982 --> 00:10:55.467
I guess I should get off these floating
platforms before they decide to stop floating.

00:10:56.296 --> 00:10:56.934
Hup!

00:10:57.975 --> 00:10:59.246
Yah!

00:10:59.246 --> 00:11:01.489
Now, there's something
interesting going on there.

00:11:01.489 --> 00:11:03.068
Not much else to do.

00:11:03.068 --> 00:11:03.734
Whoop!

00:11:05.076 --> 00:11:06.367
Wah!

00:11:07.345 --> 00:11:07.901
Hup!

00:11:08.951 --> 00:11:10.745
Ho!

00:11:10.745 --> 00:11:17.183
Yeah, this is definitely THE hangout spot
for... rocks surrounded by absolutely nothing.

00:11:17.183 --> 00:11:19.934
WHAAAAAH-HA!

00:11:22.426 --> 00:11:27.471
Well, I have no idea what this
is, but this heavy metal.

00:11:27.471 --> 00:11:30.410
It has everything... except the band.

00:11:30.410 --> 00:11:32.624
Yeah, there's not much here, is there?

00:11:32.624 --> 00:11:35.576
I may have screwed myself on this jump.

00:11:35.576 --> 00:11:37.479
I'll try and remain calm.

00:11:37.479 --> 00:11:40.980
Yeah, this IS for a band! This looks
sort of like the Godsmack logo.

00:11:40.980 --> 00:11:41.801
VOICE #1: Big day today, Freeman.

00:11:41.801 --> 00:11:42.420
What?
VOICE #2: My God!

00:11:42.420 --> 00:11:43.229
VOICE #3: Get him out of there!

00:11:43.229 --> 00:11:44.282
VOICE #4: ...in the first place!
VOICE #3: Shut down the equipment

00:11:44.282 --> 00:11:45.534
VOICE #3: and someone get him out.

00:11:45.534 --> 00:11:46.909
YEAH! GET ME OUT!

00:11:46.909 --> 00:11:50.007
CAN YOU SEE ME?! IS THAT WHAT
THIS IS?! A TRANSMITTER?!

00:11:50.007 --> 00:11:50.991
HELLO!

00:11:50.991 --> 00:11:51.967
VOICE #5: They're waiting for you, Gordon,

00:11:51.967 --> 00:11:53.684
VOICE #6: Why didn't they listen?
VOICE #5: in the Test Chamber.

00:11:53.684 --> 00:11:55.601
VOICE #7: I wanted a cheeseburger!

00:11:55.601 --> 00:11:58.647
Huh. This is just random chatter.

00:11:58.647 --> 00:12:03.262
This is an intergalactic CB, but
I think it's just getting old signals.

00:12:03.836 --> 00:12:07.694
Is there a switch in the back?
Maybe I can set it to broadcast.

00:12:07.694 --> 00:12:08.762
No.

00:12:08.762 --> 00:12:13.482
Well, I have PLENTY of time to
learn how to use this, don't I?

00:12:13.482 --> 00:12:17.626
